1
00:00:00,229 --> 00:00:02,059
(Leonard:)Really?

2
00:00:02,064 --> 00:00:03,194
(Raj:)I know.

3
00:00:03,199 --> 00:00:05,269
(Sheldon:)It's not fair.

4
00:00:07,869 --> 00:00:10,309
(Sheldon:)Let the anger
go, buddy.

5
00:00:10,306 --> 00:00:11,806
(Sheldon:)You just...

6
00:00:11,807 --> 00:00:14,507
(Sheldon:)you relax all
your muscles.

7
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:17,180
(Sheldon:)Except for your pubococcygeus
and anal sphincter.

8
00:00:17,179 --> 00:00:19,749
(Sheldon:)Let's keep those tight.

9
00:00:19,749 --> 00:00:23,049
Uh, that-that's not necessary.

10
00:00:23,052 --> 00:00:25,682
(Sheldon:)It is-- they're what hold back
the urine and the feces.

11
00:00:25,688 --> 00:00:28,518
Look, maybe-maybe
you shouldn't read it.

12
00:00:28,524 --> 00:00:30,554
(Sheldon:)It'll only make you feel worse.

13
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:33,059
"Cooper and his team"?

14
00:00:33,062 --> 00:00:35,492
(Sheldon:)You should know
I had nothing to do with that.

15
00:00:35,498 --> 00:00:37,668
(Sheldon:)Uh...

16
00:00:37,667 --> 00:00:40,267
(Leonard:)at least they're talking
about the theory.

17
00:00:40,269 --> 00:00:42,499
(Leonard:)I mean, that's what's important.

18
00:00:42,505 --> 00:00:45,075
(Sheldon:)You know, you're right.

19
00:00:45,074 --> 00:00:48,074
(Sheldon:)Yeah. You know, it's like
when Stan Lee and Steve Ditko

20
00:00:48,077 --> 00:00:49,807
(Sheldon:)created Spider-Man.

21
00:00:49,812 --> 00:00:51,742
(Sheldon:)Stan Lee may get all the credit,

22
00:00:51,747 --> 00:00:54,647
(Sheldon:)but Steve Ditko knows
he was just as important.

23
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:57,520
(Sheldon:)Even though Stan Lee gets
to be in all the Marvel movies.

24
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,250
And-and he's far richer.

25
00:00:59,255 --> 00:01:01,455
(Sheldon:)And he's a household name,
you know?

